            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-leak"><action>Sızıntının yerini belirleyin ve bildirin. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYATANK" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA2" subSystemCode="1" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="310" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
