            <isolationProcedureEnd id="end-clean"><action>Radyatörleri ve ızgaraları temizleyin. <dmRef><dmRefIdent><dmCode modelIdentCode="NAYATANK" systemDiffCode="AAA" systemCode="DA1" subSystemCode="3" subSubSystemCode="0" assyCode="00" disassyCode="00" disassyCodeVariant="AA" infoCode="250" infoCodeVariant="A" itemLocationCode="A"/></dmRefIdent></dmRef></action></isolationProcedureEnd>
